  "body": "Submitted by @&#8203;kegan:matrix.org\nIf Alice sends a message, can we reasonably assume that Alice has read all the messages before the message she sends? Given we use up-to markers rather than per-message receipts, this may be an okay assumption to make.\n\n(Imported from https://matrix.org/jira/browse/SPEC-263)\n",
